<title>MEXICO: Mexico Cetes rate soars on late speculation.</title>
<headline>Mexico Cetes rate soars on late speculation.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican overnight Cetes rates leaped 370 basis points to 23.50 percent in late trade on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dealers said a big player with a heavy liquidity position forced up rates with a hefty trade of 300 million pesos, to take advantage of demand for liquidity.</p>
<p>Many banks needed liquidity to meet Wednesday's deadline to settle balances outstanding on checking accounts they hold with the central bank, traders added.</p>
<p>((--Elena Vega, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9554))</p>
